# Bloodmoon "The Ritual of the Gifts": the six Standing Stones of Solstheim
# each set a ritual -- follow the Swimmer to the Water of Life, play the Song
# of the Earth, replant the First Trees, free the Good Beast, free the Sun from
# the Halls of Penumbra, and release the Winds from the Greedy Man's bag. With
# all six done Tharsten Heart-Fang hands over the Mace of Aevar Stonesinger.
# Position, PositionCell and setting the player just behind the Swimmer stand
# in for the walks and swims, kills for the
# fights, and RemoveItem/AddItem for looting a body. Ref FormIDs carry
# Bloodmoon.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from bm_water
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# The Chamber of Song plays a tune on its steam pipes; playing it back twice
# over teaches the Song of the Earth.
case bm_earth
run
player->Position -207663 167082 1421 180
wait 30
activate 06E47777
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 10
run
player->PositionCell 4449 9550 11700 0 "Solstheim, Chamber of Song"
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 20
activate 06AE89E4
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 30
wait 10
activate 06CF7E60
wait 10
activate 0640D712
wait 10
activate 06CF7E60
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 40
wait 10
activate 0640D712
wait 10
activate 06CF7E60
wait 10
activate 06AE89E4
wait 10
activate 0640D712
until 900 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 50
run
player->Position -207663 167082 1421 180
wait 30
activate 06E47777
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Earth == 100
end

# A riekling has stolen the Seeds of the First Trees and set spriggans to
# guard him; the seeds go back into the fertile soil by the Stone.
case bm_trees
run
player->Position -178382 174065 1426 180
wait 30
activate 06EAFD58
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Trees == 10
run
player->Position -171528 175100 876 0
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Trees == 20
console 0657ABFB.kill
run
"BM_riekling_st_UNIQUE"->RemoveItem BM_Seeds_UNIQUE 1
player->AddItem BM_Seeds_UNIQUE 1
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Trees == 30
run
player->Position -179910 174220 1309 0
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Trees == 40
run
player->Position -178382 174065 1426 180
wait 30
activate 06EAFD58
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Trees == 100
end

# Rieklings have shot the Good Beast, a bear in the south; once they are dead
# the arrow comes out and the bear walks with the player back to the Stone.
case bm_beasts
run
player->Position -159404 200971 1382 180
wait 30
activate 06627D68
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Beasts == 10
run
player->Position -158694 183250 836 0
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Beasts == 20
console 066C4CB7.kill
console 06DBD610.kill
console 06C1AAC3.kill
console 06BDCAEE.kill
console 062FFC57.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Beasts == 30
run
"BM_bear_be_UNIQUE"->RemoveItem BM_arrow_riekling_uni 1
player->AddItem BM_arrow_riekling_uni 1
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Beasts == 50
run
player->Position -159404 200971 1382 180
wait 30
activate 06627D68
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Beasts == 100
end

# The Sun is held behind an ice wall in the Halls of Penumbra; the ice troll
# guarding it carries the flaming eye that melts the wall.
case bm_sun
run
player->Position -161750 159674 1777 180
wait 30
activate 06D9EA51
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Sun == 10
run
player->PositionCell -119 200 -140 0 "Solstheim, Halls of Penumbra"
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Sun == 20
run
player->PositionCell 134 7000 -1600 0 "Solstheim, Halls of Penumbra"
until 600 GetJournalIndex BM_Sun == 30
console 067AE567.kill
run
"BM_ice_troll_sun"->RemoveItem ingred_eyeball_unique 1
player->AddItem ingred_eyeball_unique 1
activate 063197F4
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Sun == 40
run
player->Position -161750 159674 1777 180
wait 30
activate 06D9EA51
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Sun == 100
end

# The Greedy Man of Glenschul's Tomb keeps the Winds in his bag.
case bm_wind
run
player->Position -178242 205690 185 180
wait 30
activate 06C6B697
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Wind == 10
run
player->PositionCell 14 -3552 -70 180 "Solstheim, Glenschul's Tomb"
until 600 GetPCCell "Solstheim, Glenschul's Tomb" == 1
wait 30
activate 0653835F
close ContainerMenu
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Wind == 50
run
player->Position -178242 205690 185 180
wait 30
activate 06C6B697
until 300 GetJournalIndex BM_Wind == 100
end

# The Swimmer, a horker off the western coast, leads the way to the sea cave
# that holds the Water of Life.
